  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>潜影镜改进</h2>\n<p>潜影镜改进是一款为原版 Minecraft 潜影镜添加多种功能与改进的模组。</p>\n<h3>功能：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>兼容 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accessories</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">, Trinkets&nbsp;</a>和&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios-continuation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios </a>API 等装备槽位模组。</li>\n<li>使用鼠标滚轮调节潜影镜缩放倍率。</li>\n<li>按 'Z' 键快速使用潜影镜。</li>\n<li>提供多种潜影镜视野遮罩。</li>\n<li>使用潜影镜时隐藏准星。</li>\n<li>启用潜影镜平滑视角移动</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>截图：</h3>\n<h3><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZwHQL2g.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/584/clear.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"797\" height=\"449\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/585/circle.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"798\" height=\"449\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/425/586/none.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"799\" height=\"449\"></h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h2>NeoForge 安装指南</h2>\n<p>本模组需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>。您可以从 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spyglass-improvements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge 页面</a> 下载潜影镜改进，请务必下载 NeoForge 版本。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>安装 NeoForge。</li>\n<li>将模组 JAR 文件放入 mods 文件夹。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>若要启用装备槽位功能，可使用以下任意一项：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accessories </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Fabric 安装指南</h2>\n<p>本模组需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>。您可以从 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spyglass-improvements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge 页面</a> 下载潜影镜改进，请务必下载 Fabric 版本。<br>将模组和 Fabric API 的 JAR 文件放入 mods 文件夹。</p>\n<p>若要启用装备槽位功能，可使用以下任意一项：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accessories</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trinkets</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>捐赠：</h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">游玩并分享本模组已是对我最大的支持，但如果您仍想捐赠，可通过 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253fhosted_button_id%253dWAXD3QAA4LV94%2526item_name%253dSpyglass%2bImprovements(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_s-xclick\" rel=\"nofollow\">此链接 &lt;3</a><br></span></p>\n<h3>许可协议：</h3>\n<p>Spyglass-improvements 采用自由开源的 <a href=\"https://github.com/juancarloscp52/spyglass-improvements/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">GPL-3.0 许可证</a> 发布。</p>",
